{
    "$comment": [
        "ONE URL, THE SAME ROWS, ON BOTH STACKS. Canonical in query-builder-for-laravel",
        "(tests/Fixtures/contract/), copied byte-identical to query-builder-for-node",
        "(tests/goldens/contract/); ./parity.sh cmp-checks the pair.",
        "",
        "Each stack creates `table` with `columns`, inserts `rows`, declares `filters` (Laravel:",
        "AllowedFilter::operators(), or ::nullable() when `nullable`; Node: sqlFilters()) and",
        "`sorts` with `default_sort`, then answers each case's `query` string against a REAL",
        "Postgres (the pgsql leg on both sides). `ids` is the result in order: the requested",
        "sorts (else the default), then `id` ascending as the tiebreak. `error` names the 400",
        "(unknown_filter / unknown_sort) and `message` its exact text."
    ],
    "table": "parity_items",
    "columns": [
        {
            "name": "id",
